  "description": "Change of use from laundrette (Use Class E) to residential (C3) to enlarge the existing dwelling located to the rear of the unit, alongside associated external alterations.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The proposed development, by reason of a lack of submitted marketing evidence to demonstrate there is no realistic prospect of the Class E unit being used for retail (or other Class E uses), would result in the unjustified loss of a retail (Class E) service, to the detriment of local service provision and access to day to day necessities&amp;nbsp;for local residents, contrary to Hackney Local Plan (2020) policy LP36 (B) and London Plan (adopted 2021) policy E9.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of a loss of a former Class A (now Class E) use and loss of an active frontage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;, would result in the unjustified loss of a retail (Class E) service and active frontage, to the detriment of local service provision, the local shopping parade and access to day to day necessities&amp;nbsp;for local residents, contrary to Hackney Local Plan (2020) policy LP36 (A) and London Plan (adopted 2021) policy E9.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
